{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/346677-new-endowments-for-thule-loyalists-applied-secrets","id":346677,"title":"New Endowments for Thule Loyalists: Applied Secrets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-21T08:37:18-08:00","id":346677,"title":"New Endowments for Thule Loyalists: Applied Secrets","content":"EDIT: I forgot to mention that you can reduce the number of successes and/or time per roll for creating portals if you think the process is too slow.<br /> <br /> I figured that this Compact needed a little more oomph, since they are experts in occult lore. Please tell me what you think about this idea. If you think of any other Applied Secrets, let me know. I might make rules for them.<br /> <br /> Applied Secrets<br /> <br /> You can use your knowledge of the supernatural and the occult for more practical goals. These Endowments are not meant to be overly complicated or combat oriented: Loyalists, thematically speaking, are scholars before powerhouses. Applied secrets cannot be used on the spot: they require a bit of preparation. This is why Loyalists do as much research about the enemy as possible before going to the front lines so the prepared tactic doesn\u2019t turn out to be useless, or worse yet, actually empower the enemy.<br /> <br /> Ward (1 to 5)<br /> <br /> By writing special symbols around the perimeter of an area, you can protect against supernatural means of spying and infiltration. It does not make the protected area\u2019s structures any sturdier, though. Each dot purchased in this Applied Secret allows you to ward against one source of supernatural effect, such as mages, vampires or werewolves. Once the work is complete, the symbols disappear into the area\u2019s structures and remain undetectable.<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Dexterity + Occult<br /> <br /> Time Per Roll: 30 minutes. You may decrease it to 15 minutes (-2 penalty).<br /> <br /> Required Successes: proportional to the size of the area to be protected. A possible guideline is to start at 5 for a smallish room, 10 for a house, 25 for a mansion and 50 for a building.<br /> <br /> Duration: a number of days equal to current willpower rating. See the Drawback, however.<br /> <br /> Roll Results:<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: supernatural beings find a mistake in the symbols that was overlooked and actually makes it easier for them to spy or infiltrate the area. The penalty is turned into a bonus for them.<br /> <br /> Failure: no progress is made.<br /> <br /> Success: spying or infiltrating the area through supernatural means cannot be boosted with willpower and suffers a penalty equal to the character\u2019s Occult.<br /> <br /> Exceptional Successes: you may add the highest between Resolve and Composure to the penalty.<br /> <br /> Drawback: you may only ward a number of areas equal to the lowest between Resolve and Composure. Also, you must spend 1 willpower point to activate the ward, which lasts for one scene. Each area can be protected against multiple types of supernatural powers, however.<br /> <br /> Portal (1 to 3)<br /> <br /> You may create gateways that allow you to go from point A to point B without crossing the space between them. This requires you to write symbols on each location. Each dot spent on this Applied Secret allows you to create one pair of portals. Once the work is complete, the words disappear into the gateways\u2019 structures and remain undetectable.<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Wits + Occult<br /> <br /> Time Per Roll: 1 week, with 6 hours of work per day<br /> <br /> Required Successes: proportional to the distance between point A and point B. Within same city might need 25, same state 50, same country 75, same continent 100, different continent 125. Status among Thule Loyalists makes this quicker: 1 dot gives 9 Again, 3 dots gives 8 Again and 5 dots gives rote quality. You must spend 1 willpower point per roll. You may spend an additional point of willpower per roll to add 5 bonus successes. You may stop the process, but if you don\u2019t start again in two weeks, the accumulated successes are lost.<br /> <br /> Duration: a number of months equal to your current willpower rating.<br /> <br /> Drawback: each time you use a portal, you must spend 1 willpower point and it remains open for a number of turns equal to your Wits + Occult after the last person in your cell goes through it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 12-21-2014, 07:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}